<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Japan Resident Tax Calculator + The Year-2 Pay Drop, Explained | yuzucalc"
  description="Resident tax (juminzei) from last year's salary: income levy, per-capita levy, forest tax, adjustment credit, and the June instalment split. Plus the first-year-in-Japan explainer: why pay drops in year 2."
